      "side": 1,
      "message": "The jist of this change is the yuvconstants produce 2.14 that will be output as 8 bit using v \u003e\u003e 6.  But with rounding that is achieved by adding +32 into the constants.  Which is the wrong rounding value for 10 bit.  So when outputting 10 bit RGB the conants are adjusted by -32 to remove the 8 bit rounding, and +8 to add rounding for 10 bit.  This is done outside the loop by adjusting the constants after loading them.",
